From: Taoufik Mouadab <27153304+TaoufikGFX@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0002] Core: unlimited repeat, accurate seek previews, hardware snapshots, hotkeys

- vlc_player_SetRepeatCount(): UINT_MAX means unlimited, applies to the running input
- Thumbnailer: honour decoder preroll, media-relative PTS, lower priority, 2 threads
- Snapshots from hardware-decoded video (copy-back to CPU), SHM blending fix
- Wayland: a window provider can own the surface viewport
- Hotkeys: Left/Right 5 s, Shift 10 s, Ctrl 60 s (DVD navigation on Alt+arrows)

Applies on top of VLC upstream commit e77e49b5dff7484dbf70cd1540a6a568e1890280.
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
